# (see src/lib/legalDocuments.ts). That repo's Prettier omits semicolons and this one's
# adds them, so no single file satisfies both formatters - and `format:write` rewriting
# this copy is exactly the silent drift the arrangement exists to prevent.
#
# It is authored in the order server's style and copied here unchanged. `npm run
# verify:legal` fails if the two stop matching.
src/lib/legalDocuments.ts

# The design tokens are shared with the customer app the same way (see REDESIGN.md). JSON
# leaves the two formatters less to disagree about than TypeScript does, but a formatter
# rewriting this copy would still break the byte-for-byte match. `npm run verify:tokens`
# fails if the two stop matching.
src/styles/designTokens.json

